{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479/events","html_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479","id":229842949,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMjk4NDI5NDk=","number":479,"title":"orWhere breaks setFirstResult / setMaxResult","user":{"login":"emorris00","id":6057037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTcwMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6057037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00","html_url":"https://github.com/emorris00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emorris00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":333605711,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMzM2MDU3MTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2017-05-19T00:56:38Z","updated_at":"2017-06-03T09:52:32Z","closed_at":"2017-06-03T09:52:32Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I believe this is also a problem with skip / take.\r\n\r\nWhen you use setFirstResult and setMaxResult the querybuilder runs 2 queries behind the scenes. The first query gets the entity ids and the second query gets the entities. When executing the second query to get the entities from the ids, it clones the query and adds an andWhere.\r\nhttps://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/blob/master/src/query-builder/QueryBuilder.ts#L1046\r\nIf the original query had an orWhere in it, it breaks because the end query is:\r\n`WHERE test1 OR test2 AND ids IN (...)`\r\n\r\nAdding paranthesis to make it clear how it executes:\r\n`WHERE test1 OR (test2 AND ids IN (...))`\r\n\r\nIt needs to be:\r\n`WHERE (test1 OR test2) AND ids IN (...)`\r\n\r\n\r\nSome example code to reproduce:\r\n```javascript\r\n@Entity()\r\nclass Test {\r\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\r\n    id: number\r\n\r\n    @Column()\r\n    column1: string\r\n}\r\n\r\ncreateConnection({\r\n    // connection options\r\n}).then(async connection => {\r\n    var repository = connection.getRepository(Test)\r\n\r\n    var result = await repository\r\n        .createQueryBuilder('test')\r\n        .where(\"test.column1 LIKE :filter\")\r\n        .orWhere(\"test.column1 LIKE :filter\")\r\n        .setParameter(\"filter\", \"%%\")\r\n        .setFirstResult(0) // or skip\r\n        .setMaxResults(1) // or take\r\n        .getMany()\r\n\r\n    // result will have every Test instead of just the first one\r\n})\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/479/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}